+/*
+ * qgo_varint is quicvarint.Parse
+ * (vendor/quic-go/quicvarint/varint.go): the length from the top two
+ * bits of the first byte, and any encoding of a value accepted,
+ * shortest or not.  It returns the length read, or 0 when |n| bytes do
+ * not hold it.
